{"id":"u-31c97bfb-4e25-43c3-a196-1b7df8272c29","src":"community","title":"Hybrid Longevity and Strength","author":"Oli Thomas","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/2gXsES-hybrid-longevity-and-strength","desc":"Be sure to effectively warm up and cool down after every workout. Take 2-3 minutes rest between sets and exercises. Keep your hydration levels up, and nutrition on point. \n\nThis is an intermediate level program, although is adaptable to all levels. \n\nThis program focuses on strength, longevity, mobility, injury prevention and conditioning whilst maintaining the identity of lifting weights in traditional ways. \n\nThis is designed to help those who have come back from injury, want to adapt their training to prevent future injuries, or the average person simply looking to make a change from the traditional hypertrophic, body building training routine. \n\nI have personally run this program after having a rotator cuff injury and it has benefitted me big time, but don’t take my word for it, give it a try and leave your review below to let others know how you’ve gotten on and if it’s worked for you!","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Athletics","Women's","Bodyweight Fitness"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-04-01T16:18:02.583Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Lower Body Strength & Carries","Upper Body Strength","Conditioning & Movement","Full Body Perfomance"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Trap Bar Deadlift","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":6.5},{"r":6,"rpe":7,"x":2},{"r":6,"rpe":8}]},{"n":"Rear Foot Elevated Split Squat","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Hamstring Curl","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Farmer's Walk (Weighted)","sets":[{"sec":30,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"note":"0.5 = 30 seconds"},{"n":"Plank","sets":[{"sec":60,"rpe":10,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":7,"x":4}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Chest S